  "coaching": {
    "summary": "The decision is well-structured with a hard deadline, a budget ceiling, and a compliance gate already represented. The main gaps are around what happens if migration slips past March and whether team capacity is treated as a hard constraint or a soft one.",
    "strengthen_items": [
      {
        "id": "add-contract-expiry-risk",
        "label": "Make the March deadline a distinct risk",
        "detail": "The brief states the contract renews in March, so a failed or delayed migration could force an unwanted renewal at unknown cost — this consequence is not yet captured as a separate risk beyond migration delay.",
        "action_type": "add_risk",
        "bias_category": "narrow_framing"
      },
      {
        "id": "add-vendor-lock-in-risk",
        "label": "Surface long-term vendor dependency as a risk",
        "detail": "Choosing a managed SaaS platform creates ongoing dependency on that vendor's pricing and roadmap, which is a material risk for a two-person team with limited renegotiation leverage — this is absent from the current structure.",
        "action_type": "add_risk",
        "bias_category": "overconfidence"
      },
      {
        "id": "add-team-skill-constraint",
        "label": "Distinguish team skill from team capacity",
        "detail": "The brief notes the team 'can't absorb much operational overhead,' but building on Snowflake with Fivetran also requires specific engineering skills; separating skill availability from headroom would sharpen how the Snowflake build option is evaluated.",
        "action_type": "add_constraint"
      },
      {
        "id": "reframe-goal-to-include-scalability",
        "label": "Broaden the goal to include future scalability",
        "detail": "The current goal focuses on replacing the CDP within budget and compliance constraints, but a platform that meets those constraints today may not scale with data volume or team growth — adding a scalability dimension would prevent a locally optimal but strategically weak choice.",
        "action_type": "reframe_goal",
        "bias_category": "narrow_framing"
      }
    ],
    "widening_log": {
      "elements_added": [],
      "elements_considered_but_excluded": [
